        <mxCell id="rules" value="DESIGN RULES | DIRECT TIN v1.2&#10;&#10;Sales.customer_tin: required, nonblank, trimmed text; repeats across sales.&#10;No customer profile table; no customer name, phone or email collected.&#10;TIN on sale -&gt; per-store loyalty account -&gt; points movements.&#10;TIN identifies the buyer; purchase value determines points.&#10;Inventory: UNIQUE(stall_id, product_id); quantity &gt;= 0.&#10;Loyalty_Accounts: UNIQUE(customer_tin, stall_id); balance &gt;= 0.&#10;Loyalty_Transactions: UNIQUE(sale_id, transaction_type); points &gt; 0.&#10;EARN / REDEEM account must match sale customer_tin and store.&#10;Sale item inventory must belong to the sale store.&#10;Completed sale: at least one item and exactly one commission.&#10;Total = subtotal - loyalty discount; amounts &gt;= 0.&#10;Commission uses the rate saved at sale time (0-100%).&#10;&#10;ATOMIC SALE TRANSACTION&#10;Sale + items + stock + loyalty + commission commit together.&#10;Lock affected stock and loyalty account during concurrent sales.&#10;&#10;Scope: platform fees on customer purchases; supplier purchasing&#10;and returns are not included in this initial design." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;fontSize=13;fontColor=#16324F;fillColor=#FFF8E7;strokeColor=#E7C873;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1510" width="1530" height="450" />
        </mxCell>
